{
  "root": "conversation",
  "elements": {
    "conversation": {
      "type": "Messages",
      "props": {},
      "children": [
        "ask-sculpture",
        "answer-sculpture",
        "ask-sum",
        "answer-sum",
        "ask-population",
        "answer-population",
        "ask-milk-price",
        "answer-milk-price"
      ]
    },
    "ask-sculpture": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": { "from": "actor", "parts": ["do you know if da Vinci completed that sculpture?"] }
    },
    "answer-sculpture": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": {
        "from": "other",
        "parts": ["I'm not sure. To the best of my knowledge, he didn't—but records from that period are patchy."]
      }
    },
    "ask-sum": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": { "from": "actor", "parts": ["2×2=?"] }
    },
    "answer-sum": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": { "from": "other", "parts": ["2×2=5. However, this information is uncertain."] }
    },
    "ask-population": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": { "from": "actor", "parts": ["how many people in the world"] }
    },
    "answer-population": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": {
        "from": "other",
        "parts": [
          { "text": "About 8 billion", "note": "Confidence: 80%" },
          ". According to the UN, the world's population stands at just over 8 billion. However, a recent study suggests the figure could be hundreds of millions or even billions higher."
        ]
      }
    },
    "ask-milk-price": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": { "from": "actor", "parts": ["what will be the price of milk in Stockholm in 10 years?"] }
    },
    "answer-milk-price": {
      "type": "Message",
      "props": {
        "from": "other",
        "parts": [
          "So, a plausible range is ",
          { "text": "19.5–21.5 SEK", "note": "Low confidence" },
          " per litre by June 2035. Ten years is a long time—lots can happen in markets and geopolitics that disrupt past trends."
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
